1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,800
I sell white label media services to PR firms.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,520
We've been stuck at 1.5 million for five years.

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,720
Agencies come to you.

4
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:08,560
Yeah.

5
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,760
They then white label your services

6
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,160
and sell your stuff to other people.

7
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,000
That's exactly right.

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,480
Do you have the same number of agencies

9
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:15,520
that are selling your stuff last year as this year

10
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,920
and the year before that and the year before that?

11
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,680
It's pretty high churn for the most part.

12
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,080
Are they churning because they're not using the articles

13
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,240
or because the articles are not good?

14
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,080
Because they're not using it.

15
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,480
You probably need a lower tier

16
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,960
that has some sort of usage component added on.

17
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:28,440
So it might be something like $1.99 a month

18
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,480
plus $100 per article.

19
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:31,320
You want to be low enough

20
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,240
that they don't churn on their bad months.

21
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,440
And so that's the fundamental issues.

22
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:36,480
I think that you're priced too high

23
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,280
for the majority of your customers

24
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,440
and too low for the ones

25
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,440
that you're going to maximize profit on.

